    "title": "Reckless driving, organization of unauthorized speed contests (1)(a)",
    "text": "It is unlawful for a person to: Drive a vehicle in willful or wanton disregard of the safety of persons or property on a highway or premises to which the public has access.",
    "source": "NRS 484B.653(1)(a)"
  },
